### personal data — never commit ###
# The submitted readme carries the submitter's identity number. It ships inside the submission zip
# and has no business in a public repository; README.md is the public-facing document instead.
docs/readme.docx

### JavaFX SDK ###
# 12 MB of third-party binaries. They ship inside the submission zip, but there is no reason to
# carry them in the history: README.md says which build to fetch and where to unpack it.
lib/javafx/

### graphify ###
# Local working directory of the graphify tool. Everything in it is generated from the source in
# seconds by "graphify extract . --code-only", and the graph alone runs to well over a megabyte,
# so none of it belongs in the history.
graphify-out/

